              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "Every student deserves an education that helps them reach their dreams, whatever they may be. At Zeta High, we know, challenge, and love every student so they can discover and explore their passions and purpose. We equip them with the knowledge, critical thinking, and experiences to turn their passions into their life’s work.<br />"
