              },
              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : "{!$brand.typography.paragraph.paragraph1}",
              "text" : "<span dir=\"ltr\">At Zeta High, you will be:<br /><br /></span><ul dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:0.5rem 0px;list-style-position:outside;list-style-type:disc\"><li style=\"margin:0.35rem 0px\"><strong>Known:</strong> You will belong to one of four Z Houses, where you become a member for life, as well as a Z Pod of 12 classmates and one Z Coach who meet every Wednesday for goal-setting, mentorship, and support.</li><li style=\"margin:0.35rem 0px\"><strong>Challenged:</strong> You will take Advanced Placement courses from freshman year, SAT prep during the school day, and Z Lab, where you can build robots, design products, and turn your idea into a business. You can join a sports team, take the stage, try Taekwondo or Hip-Hop, or start a club of your own.</li><li style=\"margin:0.35rem 0px\"><strong>Loved:</strong> You will find your people: friends who will grow with you for four years and beyond, classmates who introduce you to something new, and adults who see your potential.</li></ul><span dir=\"ltr\">At Zeta High, we equip you for the future. You will go on college visits, engage in individualized college guidance, and have conversations with people doing work that interests you. Along the way, you will build a portfolio that gives you a chance to tell your story. <br /><br />To learn more about what high school could look like for you, come visit us! Explore our spaces, meet our students and teachers, and imagine your future at Zeta High.<br /><br /><br /><strong>With love,</strong><br /><br /><strong>Emily Kim<br />Founder &amp; CEO<br />Zeta Charter Schools</strong><br /><br /><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta. Our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way. ✉︎  <a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</font></u></a></em><a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\"><u> </u></a>&#x1f4de;(646) 480-1654</span>"
            },
